NPA FastWAM runtime notice
===========================

This image recipe enables the ``fastwam`` optional feature from the upstream
LeRobot 0.6.1 distribution. It does not include FastWAM, Wan, UMT5, robot
dataset, checkpoint, cache, or rollout-output bytes in an image layer.

